\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {19.1}{\ignorespaces The observability pipeline. Application code depends only on the OTel API; the SDK assembles spans and metric aggregations; the exporter ships OTLP to the collector, which batches, redacts, optionally tail-samples, and fans out to one backend per signal. Vendor changes happen at the collector, never in application code.}}{1238}{figure.19.1}\protected@file@percent }
