\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {19.3}{\ignorespaces The long tail, plotted from Listing~18.4's seeded distribution. Half of all requests finish in 25\,ms, yet the \emph  {average} is 761\,ms --- pulled 30$\times $ above the median by a tail the naked eye almost misses --- and p99 is three buckets past the average. Any dashboard or SLO keyed on the mean is measuring a user nobody has.}}{1242}{figure.19.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ch18-longtail}{{19.3}{1242}{The long tail, plotted from Listing~18.4's seeded distribution. Half of all requests finish in 25\,ms, yet the \emph {average} is 761\,ms --- pulled 30$\times $ above the median by a tail the naked eye almost misses --- and p99 is three buckets past the average. Any dashboard or SLO keyed on the mean is measuring a user nobody has}{figure.19.3}{}}
